# Mineral silo: raises the team's mineral STORAGE CAP ("Mineral silo capacity" per silo on top of
# "Mineral base capacity") - income clamps at the cap, so banking a bigger war chest needs silos.
# No power, no grid role; just capacity that dies with it. Spawned origin 1.3 above the ground hit.
Prefab gameMineralStorage
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node Cube
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.25 0.45 1
		Scale 2
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		ContactEvents true
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 2 2 2
